imes New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>2</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>\u226520 years</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>1</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips=\"60\" data-mm-row-height-rule=\"auto\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>Levonorgestrel-releasing intrauterine system (LNG-IUS)</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Menarche to &lt;20 years</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>2</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>\u226520 years</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>1</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7647]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>Table </em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>27</em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>. </em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #44546A; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><em>UK Medical Eligibility Criteria (UKMEC) for Contraceptive Use \u2013 Based on Age</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7648]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u>Side effects</u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7649]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Bleeding pattern </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>alterations</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong> are commonly associated with POP</strong></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7650]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>12 months of use</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>: Effects of POP (Progestogen-Only Pill) on libido are lacking and therefore a possible effect cannot be excluded.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7651]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Weight change</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>: Evidence does not support a causal association between POP use and weight change.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7652]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Important consideration before providing contraction to young people</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u>:</u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7653]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Young people under 18 years to 25 years</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>:</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Whilst the </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>age of consent to sexual activity in the UK is 16 years</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>, surveys suggest that approximately </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>one in three</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> young people have had sexual intercourse by this age.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7654]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Confidentiality</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>:</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Young people should always be made aware of confidentiality policies, including situations where confidentiality may need to be breached.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7655]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Safeguarding young people</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>:</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>All sexual and reproductive health care services should have a </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>named person</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> identified as the local lead for </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>child protection</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7656]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Staff training</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>:</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>All staff involved in contraceptive services for young people should receive appropriate training to recognize </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>exploitation or coercion</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>.</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Staff must know who to contact and how to respond to </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>child protection issues</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> as per local policy.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7657]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7658]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em><strong>Contraceptive Options for Young People</strong></em></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><em>:</em></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7659]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Information and Counseling</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>:</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Young people should be informed about </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>all methods of </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>contraception</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>emphasizing the </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>benefits of LARC</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> (Long-Acting Reversible Contraceptives).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7660]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Ongoing Support</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>:</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Young people should be encouraged to return </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>at any time</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> if they develop problems with contraception.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7661]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Medical Eligibility</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>:</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Age alone should not limit contraceptive choices</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>, including </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>intrauterine methods</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7662]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7663]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>",
      "content_sha256": "4626e8586b0089b9125e55bb693be4bbffe487cb95aa550855db5bf2b9580c7d",
      "block_type": "document_html"
    }
